{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":52,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1912150,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":286552,"Name":"itscaramel","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1458760276,"LastPoster":{"Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1912150,"PostDate":1458760276,"PostContent":"Hello! \u00a0Recently engaged and planning on a beach wedding in May 2017. \u00a0We plan to rent a condo on...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ekflannery@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.180.194.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1458759451,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"itscaramel","Id":286552,"Name":"itscaramel","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.180.194.174","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80008,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b211783a2b6bce5f7a3c1914dadb04cf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello! &amp;nbsp;Recently engaged and planning on a beach wedding in May 2017. &amp;nbsp;We plan to rent a condo on the beach and use a planning company to set up the arbor. &amp;nbsp;We will have less than 10 people in attendance, so no chairs. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My dad will likely walk me down the aisle, but from where?! &amp;nbsp;Does everyone watch us walk all the way from the parking lot\/condo to the altar? &amp;nbsp;This seems so awkward! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Does anyone have ideas on how to make this less awkward?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912150,"PostDate":1458760276,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello! \u00a0Recently engaged and planning on a beach wedding in May 2017. \u00a0We plan to rent a condo on the beach and use a planning company to set up the arbor. \u00a0We will have less than 10 people in attendance, so no chairs. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My dad will likely walk me down the aisle, but from where?! \u00a0Does everyone watch us walk all the way from the parking lot\/condo to the altar? \u00a0This seems so awkward! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does anyone have ideas on how to make this less awkward?<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ekflannery@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.180.194.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1458759451,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"itscaramel","Id":286552,"Name":"itscaramel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.21.215.117","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80008,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a3f02e88d7d81727ce876aacf3c993f1","RawContent":"@[member=\"itscaramel\"] I know a few hotels that we stayed at had something similar to a path leading to the beach... One hotel in particular had a back entrance that kind of connected to the path. Good luck! Congratulations!","Attachments":[],"Id":1912151,"PostDate":1458760843,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286552\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/286552-itscaramel\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">itscaramel<\/span><\/a> I know a few hotels that we stayed at had something similar to a path leading to the beach... One hotel in particular had a back entrance that kind of connected to the path. Good luck! Congratulations!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"atwater7@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"98.240.19.233","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389463919,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276017.jpg?_r=1452312783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":139,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LADYJUSTICE","Id":276017,"Name":"LADYJUSTICE","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.32.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80008,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"89f3306eb47fd0e1d50a49269b0070d0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"itscaramel\" post=\"1912150\" timestamp=\"1458778276\"]\nHello!  Recently engaged and planning on a beach wedding in May 2017.  We plan to rent a condo on the beach and use a planning company to set up the arbor.  We will have less than 10 people in attendance, so no chairs.  \nMy dad will likely walk me down the aisle, but from where?!  Does everyone watch us walk all the way from the parking lot\/condo to the altar?  This seems so awkward!  \nDoes anyone have ideas on how to make this less awkward?\nThank you!!![\/quote]@[member=\"itscaramel\"] congrats on your engagement, usually the walk would start from where your guests can see you.  if you are coming out of the car in the parking lot no-one can see you then.  hope this helps.\n\nHappy Planning!\nJoyce","Attachments":[],"Id":1912156,"PostDate":1458775291,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>itscaramel, on Yesterday, 07:11 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello! \u00a0Recently engaged and planning on a beach wedding in May 2017. \u00a0We plan to rent a condo on the beach and use a planning company to set up the arbor. \u00a0We will have less than 10 people in attendance, so no chairs. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My dad will likely walk me down the aisle, but from where?! \u00a0Does everyone watch us walk all the way from the parking lot\/condo to the altar? \u00a0This seems so awkward! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does anyone have ideas on how to make this less awkward?<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286552\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/286552-itscaramel\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">itscaramel<\/span><\/a> congrats on your engagement, usually the walk would start from where your guests can see you. \u00a0if you are coming out of the car in the parking lot no-one can see you then. \u00a0hope this helps.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\n<p>Joyce<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326836387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80008","Title":"Beach Wedding - Walking Down The \"aisle?\"","LastPostDate":1458775291},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
