eam MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.187.189.34","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79970,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ffa0b188c7205b3273a6d84ffa06ff7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey all&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I had a wonderful destinaton wedding at Dreams La Romana, and i used this forum ALOT! But that was 5 years ago and now my sister is getting married at the Barcello Punta Cana (not the palace). I just can&#039;t find a great thread anywhere on the site.. Can someone help???&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911476,"PostDate":1456835807,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey all<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I had a wonderful destinaton wedding at Dreams La Romana, and i used this forum ALOT! But that was 5 years ago and now my sister is getting married at the Barcello Punta Cana (not the palace). I just can't find a great thread anywhere on the site.. Can someone help???\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tiggerdc@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"104.247.248.195","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1453504241,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286010.jpg?_r=1458143837","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"DanaCairns","Id":286010,"Name":"DanaCairns","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.0.142.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79970,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 02 March 2016 - 04:16 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1456935392,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"25c560ec247878db4692b932a4245bfa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey DanaCairns, great to hear how useful you found our forum community for your dw plans 5 yrs ago! In case you haven&#039;t already seen them, here&#039;s a link to some &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?s=8df49a437e8ea3a717a8ea7f9d9fa965&amp;amp;app=googlecse#gsc.tab=0&amp;amp;gsc.q=Barcelo%20Punta%20Cana&#039;&gt;BDW threads with more info on the Barcelo Punta Cana&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope it all works out for your sister just the way she envisions it - or Even BETTER!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For added inspiration, here are some magical beach wedding moments that matter taken from our&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!blog\/lwgjq&#039;&gt; MTM Blog posts &lt;\/a&gt;- enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...lil people making BIG Memories at this beautiful Sandos Cancun Wedding!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_d480596efc2c49e8b8adf1a5ff2c3a86.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_d480596efc2c49e8b8adf1a5ff2c3a86.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_d480596efc2c49e8b8adf1a5ff2c3a86.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....today I marry my Best Friend!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_72bee0d4aff14c338443f0566309538c.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_72bee0d4aff14c338443f0566309538c.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_72bee0d4aff14c338443f0566309538c.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....I only have Eyes for YOU, Dear!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_1048ba96f8454c57a39c3c490308a972.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_1048ba96f8454c57a39c3c490308a972.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_1048ba96f8454c57a39c3c490308a972.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911518,"PostDate":1456935369,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey DanaCairns, great to hear how useful you found our forum community for your dw plans 5 yrs ago! In case you haven't already seen them, here's a link to some <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?s=8df49a437e8ea3a717a8ea7f9d9fa965&app=googlecse#gsc.tab=0&gsc.q=Barcelo%20Punta%20Cana' class='bbc_url' title=''>BDW threads with more info on the Barcelo Punta Cana<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope it all works out for your sister just the way she envisions it - or Even BETTER!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For added inspiration, here are some magical beach wedding moments that matter taken from our<a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!blog\/lwgjq' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'> MTM Blog posts <\/a>- enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...lil people making BIG Memories at this beautiful Sandos Cancun Wedding!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_d480596efc2c49e8b8adf1a5ff2c3a86.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_d480596efc2c49e8b8adf1a5ff2c3a86.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_d480596efc2c49e8b8adf1a5ff2c3a86.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....today I marry my Best Friend!!!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_72bee0d4aff14c338443f0566309538c.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_72bee0d4aff14c338443f0566309538c.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_72bee0d4aff14c338443f0566309538c.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....I only have Eyes for YOU, Dear!!!!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_1048ba96f8454c57a39c3c490308a972.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_1048ba96f8454c57a39c3c490308a972.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_1048ba96f8454c57a39c3c490308a972.\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79970","Title":"Barcello Punta Cana 2016 Brides?","LastPostDate":1456935369},"Pages":{"TotalItems